  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">A right rectangular prism has a length of <math alttext=\"28 centimeters left parenthesis cm right parenthesis\"><mrow><mn>28</mn></mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>centimeters</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mtext>cm</mtext></mfenced></math>, a width of <math alttext=\"15 cm\"><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>cm</mtext></math>, and a height of <math alttext=\"16 cm\"><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>cm</mtext></math>. What is the surface area, <math alttext=\"in cm squared\"><mtext>in</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mtext>cm</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup></math>, of the right rectangular prism?</p>",
  "answerOptions": [],
